ui-material-provides-design-and-implementation-resources-for-date-selection-availability-belo = Material provides design and implementation resources for date selection. Availability below describes the Material libraries; these live examples use Tessera.

ui-m3-uses-larger-titles-and-labels-with-more-spacing-for-48dp-touch-targets-new-dynamic-colo = M3 uses larger titles and labels with more spacing for 48dp touch targets, new dynamic-color mappings and no modal shadow. The former desktop picker is now the docked date picker; the former mobile picker and input are now modal date picker and modal date input. These names describe behavior, not a device type.

ui-choose-a-calendar-for-nearby-dates-and-text-entry-for-dates-in-the-distant-past-or-future = Choose a calendar for nearby dates and text entry for dates in the distant past or future, such as a date of birth. Offer a single date for an event or an inclusive range for a reservation. Show past, present and future dates as the task allows, and distinguish today from the selected date.

ui-each-variant-exposes-its-selection-navigation-and-confirmation-controls = Each variant exposes its selection, navigation and confirmation controls.

ui-an-input-field-anchors-a-calendar-with-separate-month-and-year-menus-date-cells-and-option = An input field anchors a calendar with separate month and year menus, date cells and optional actions.

ui-supporting-text-and-a-headline-describe-the-selection-the-edit-action-switches-entry-metho = Supporting text and a headline describe the selection. The edit action switches entry method; month navigation, date cells and actions complete the dialog.

ui-the-calendar-action-returns-to-visual-selection-a-labeled-input-accepts-the-date-before-co = The calendar action returns to visual selection. A labeled input accepts the date before confirmation.

ui-full-screen-date-picker = Full-screen date picker

ui-a-close-affordance-and-save-action-frame-the-range-calendar-on-compact-windows = A close affordance and Save action frame the range calendar on compact windows.

ui-use-an-anchored-calendar-alongside-direct-date-entry = Use an anchored calendar alongside direct date entry.

ui-keep-the-editable-field-visible-when-its-calendar-is-open-docked-pickers-work-well-in-form = Keep the editable field visible when its calendar is open. Docked pickers work well in forms with enough space beside the field. Both direct text entry and calendar selection must complete the same task; clearly describe the expected date format.

ui-activate-the-calendar-icon-to-reveal-the-picker-immediately-below-the-field-its-position-s = Activate the calendar icon to reveal the picker immediately below the field. Its position stays anchored while month or year menus open. OK commits the draft; Cancel dismisses it without replacing the field's saved value.

ui-month-selection = Month selection

ui-use-previous-and-next-controls-or-open-the-month-menu-to-jump-within-the-year = Use previous and next controls or open the month menu to jump within the year.

ui-year-selection = Year selection

ui-use-the-year-controls-or-open-the-year-menu-to-navigate-distant-dates = Use the year controls or open the year menu to navigate distant dates.

ui-a-dialog-keeps-attention-on-a-pending-date-selection = A dialog keeps attention on a pending date selection.

ui-use-previous-and-next-month-controls-for-nearby-dates-the-month-and-year-selector-opens-ye = Use previous and next month controls for nearby dates. The month and year selector opens year navigation.

ui-date-range-selection = Date range selection

ui-choose-a-start-and-end-date-for-bookings-and-reservations-intermediate-dates-share-a-conne = Choose a start and end date for bookings and reservations. Intermediate dates share a connected highlight; vertical scrolling reveals other months. Keep the selected endpoints visible in the headline, and enable Save only after both endpoints form a valid range.

ui-direct-entry-is-useful-when-the-intended-date-is-already-known = Direct entry is useful when the intended date is already known.

ui-offer-numeric-entry-for-a-date-or-date-range-especially-dates-far-from-the-current-month = Offer numeric entry for a date or date range, especially dates far from the current month.

ui-the-edit-and-calendar-controls-switch-entry-methods-without-losing-the-current-selection-k = The edit and calendar controls switch entry methods without losing the current selection. Keep format guidance with each field. Reject malformed or impossible dates and ranges ending before they start, and make the reason clear before confirmation.

ui-compact-breakpoint = Compact breakpoint

ui-a-full-screen-picker-keeps-range-selection-readable-on-compact-windows-with-close-and-save = A full-screen picker keeps range selection readable on compact windows, with Close and Save at the top. Preserve touch-target sizes and scroll the months rather than compressing the calendar cells.

ui-medium-and-expanded-breakpoints = Medium and expanded breakpoints

ui-use-a-modal-dialog-or-docked-picker-where-the-layout-has-sufficient-space-a-docked-calenda = Use a modal dialog or docked picker where the layout has sufficient space. A docked calendar stays below its field, which remains available for direct entry. Keep calendars at their intended size rather than stretching cells across an expanded window.

ui-a-selected-endpoint-uses-a-filled-indicator-the-dates-between-the-endpoints-have-a-connect = A selected endpoint uses a filled indicator. The dates between the endpoints have a connected tonal highlight.

ui-appearing-and-disappearing = Appearing and disappearing

ui-confirm-or-cancel-to-dismiss-modal-selection-a-docked-calendar-appears-below-the-input-fie = Confirm or cancel to dismiss modal selection. A docked calendar appears below the input field.

ui-keep-the-calendar-at-its-intended-component-size-use-surrounding-space-rather-than-stretch = Keep the calendar at its intended component size; use surrounding space rather than stretching its date cells.

ui-support-visual-date-selection-and-manual-text-entry-so-the-calendar-is-optional-for-keyboa = Support visual date selection and manual text entry so the calendar is optional for keyboard and assistive technology users.

ui-preserve-48dp-touch-targets-and-provide-a-clearly-labeled-edit-control-for-switching-to-da = Preserve 48dp touch targets and provide a clearly labeled edit control for switching to date input.

ui-keep-the-text-field-and-calendar-button-as-separate-keyboard-stops-the-calendar-button-ope = Keep the text field and calendar button as separate keyboard stops. The calendar button opens the optional visual picker.

ui-keep-typed-text-unchanged-while-editing-validate-and-format-on-submission-rather-than-inse = Keep typed text unchanged while editing. Validate and format on submission rather than inserting separators as each character is typed. Explain the format before entry, preserve invalid input for correction, and associate validation messages with the field.

ui-optional-clear-button = Optional Clear button

ui-omit-a-clear-action-when-the-task-does-not-need-one-keeping-keyboard-traversal-concise = Omit a Clear action when the task does not need one, keeping keyboard traversal concise.

ui-affordance-for-keyboard-shortcuts = Affordance for keyboard shortcuts

ui-communicate-available-navigation-shortcuts-in-contextual-hints-and-accessible-descriptions = Communicate available navigation shortcuts in contextual hints and accessible descriptions.

ui-truncated-labels-tooltips = Truncated labels & tooltips

ui-keep-full-accessible-names-for-shortened-visible-labels-noninteractive-weekday-headings-do = Keep full accessible names for shortened visible labels. Noninteractive weekday headings do not add keyboard stops.

ui-color-contrast-between-dates = Color contrast between dates

ui-keep-date-text-legible-against-the-calendar-surface-and-selected-or-range-indicators-use-a = Keep date text legible against the calendar surface and selected or range indicators. Use at least 4.5:1 contrast for normal-size text. Use an outline for today and a filled indicator for selection so these meanings do not rely on color alone.

ui-use-the-calendar-with-keyboard-navigation-confirmation-and-dismissal-remain-explicit-actio = Use the calendar with keyboard navigation; confirmation and dismissal remain explicit actions.

ui-give-the-field-a-task-specific-label-and-a-description-of-its-date-format-name-month-and-y = Give the field a task-specific label and a description of its date format. Name month and year navigation controls.

ui-screen-reader-verbalizations = Screen reader verbalizations

ui-announce-the-complete-weekday-month-date-and-year-plus-today-or-selected-state-where-appli = Announce the complete weekday, month, date and year, plus today or selected state where applicable. For example, Sunday, August 17, 2025 remains understandable outside the calendar. Name range endpoints Start date and End date; visual weekday abbreviations are not sufficient accessible names.

